- [ ] Create Server-Side API Routes
  - [ ] Implement chat completion endpoint
  - [ ] Add streaming response handling
  - [ ] Implement error handling
  - Success criteria: Working API endpoints
  - Dependencies: OpenAI SDK setup

- [ ] Update Chat Interface
  - [ ] Connect UI to new API endpoints
  - [ ] Add loading states
  - [ ] Implement streaming message display
  - Success criteria: Working chat with OpenAI
  - Dependencies: Server API routes

- [ ] Add Error Handling & Recovery
  - [ ] Implement retry logic
  - [ ] Add user feedback for errors
  - [ ] Handle rate limits
  - Success criteria: Robust error handling
  - Dependencies: Basic integration

